1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 11=

3
00:00:53,509 --> 00:00:54,509
Mr. Nie.

4
00:00:58,829 --> 00:00:59,829
Sit.

5
00:01:11,229 --> 00:01:12,350
Jia Long?

6
00:01:12,910 --> 00:01:13,910
Yes.

7
00:01:15,750 --> 00:01:18,070
How long have you worked at Sea Breeze?

8
00:01:18,309 --> 00:01:20,110
About ten years.

9
00:01:21,509 --> 00:01:23,229
A real veteran, then.

10
00:01:25,070 --> 00:01:26,229
I'll ask you about someone.

11
00:01:26,470 --> 00:01:27,470
Go ahead, sir.

12
00:01:27,869 --> 00:01:29,110
Xia Yuyan.

13
00:01:29,789 --> 00:01:31,789
What do you think of her?

14
00:01:33,470 --> 00:01:34,470
Captain Xia?

15
00:01:34,910 --> 00:01:36,149
Well, Captain Xia is...

16
00:01:38,389 --> 00:01:39,389
She's decent

17
00:01:39,429 --> 00:01:40,429
and very capable.

18
00:01:42,830 --> 00:01:43,990
Get rid of her.

19
00:01:49,830 --> 00:01:53,630
Don't worry.
We'll pin it on Tu Jiasheng later.

20
00:01:54,550 --> 00:01:55,589
I'll take care of it.

21
00:01:56,470 --> 00:01:59,589
Mr. Nie, killing isn't really my thing.

22
00:01:59,750 --> 00:02:00,949
And the one behind her...

23
00:02:00,949 --> 00:02:01,990
Once it's done,

24
00:02:03,309 --> 00:02:06,750
I'll have you replace Tang Zhen
and run Sea Breeze.

25
00:02:08,309 --> 00:02:10,149
Of course, you can refuse.

26
00:02:10,750 --> 00:02:12,229
But if you do,

27
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:14,309
you won't be going back.

28
00:02:14,309 --> 00:02:17,949
After all, I can't let someone
who knows my plan

29
00:02:18,630 --> 00:02:20,430
leave this room alive.

30
00:02:25,229 --> 00:02:26,229
Deal.

31
00:02:27,269 --> 00:02:28,269
I can do it.

32
00:02:28,470 --> 00:02:29,509
I won't let you down.

33
00:02:41,109 --> 00:02:43,470
If there's nothing else,
I'll take my leave.

34
00:02:49,070 --> 00:02:51,989
Feng, what about Lu?

35
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:54,789
He was the one
who let Yu Yingwan and the others go.

36
00:02:55,190 --> 00:02:58,070
He was also the one who cut off
Phachai's cigarette and liquor supply.

37
00:02:58,150 --> 00:03:00,190
Besides, Lu fired a shot that day.

38
00:03:00,269 --> 00:03:01,590
If he hadn't fired that shot,

39
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:03,870
we couldn't have
let Yu Yingwan and the others go.

40
00:03:03,870 --> 00:03:06,549
Right. He's been secretly working
with Tu Jiasheng all along,

41
00:03:06,669 --> 00:03:07,669
colluding from inside.

42
00:03:09,350 --> 00:03:11,750
Since he wants to be with
Tu Jiasheng so badly,

43
00:03:13,350 --> 00:03:14,590
let's grant his wish.

44
00:03:15,509 --> 00:03:18,590
Where's Yu Yingwan? Bring her over here!

45
00:03:19,109 --> 00:03:22,109
Tell her I'm going to
have her right now!

46
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:24,630
Ms. Bai,

47
00:03:25,190 --> 00:03:26,750
you let her go.

48
00:03:27,190 --> 00:03:30,310
You should explain it
to Mr. Zhang yourself.

49
00:03:31,949 --> 00:03:33,229
Yu Yingwan is my girl.

50
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:35,590
Hitting her is disrespecting Prosperity.

51
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:41,590
Tonight's drinks are on me,

52
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:45,829
but you can't touch her.

53
00:03:49,829 --> 00:03:50,989
Who do you think you are?

54
00:03:51,109 --> 00:03:52,750
I've shown you due respect.

55
00:03:53,190 --> 00:03:54,549
Push it, and I won't be polite.

56
00:03:55,310 --> 00:03:56,949
Are you talking to me?

57
00:03:59,549 --> 00:04:02,229
Mr. Zhang, don't be angry.

58
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:04,389
Yu Yingwan is just one girl.

59
00:04:05,109 --> 00:04:08,310
Look how gorgeous Ms. Bai is,

60
00:04:08,310 --> 00:04:10,190
with such a stunning figure.

61
00:04:12,549 --> 00:04:13,549
Great idea.

62
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:15,190
What are you doing?

63
00:04:15,430 --> 00:04:17,750
Tonight, I'm having you instead.

64
00:04:18,590 --> 00:04:21,109
Let go! Let go of me!

65
00:04:21,269 --> 00:04:23,109
- Come on.
- Let go of me!

66
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,630
Let go of me!

67
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:53,430
Let go of me!

68
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:55,709
It was this hand, right?

69
00:05:10,230 --> 00:05:11,230
That's enough.

70
00:05:15,415 --> 00:05:16,415
Enough.

71
00:05:16,656 --> 00:05:17,656
Stop it.

72
00:06:10,630 --> 00:06:11,630
Who are you?

73
00:06:28,230 --> 00:06:29,230
Does it hurt?

74
00:06:29,949 --> 00:06:31,029
It's no big deal.

75
00:06:33,670 --> 00:06:35,149
After everything that's happened,

76
00:06:35,310 --> 00:06:36,790
why still protect Bai Ruxue?

77
00:06:38,349 --> 00:06:39,630
The only reason she's so brazen

78
00:06:39,790 --> 00:06:41,310
is that Nie Feng is backing her.

79
00:06:43,949 --> 00:06:45,430
Prosperity isn't what it used to be.

80
00:06:46,349 --> 00:06:47,389
From now on,

81
00:06:47,670 --> 00:06:48,790
you can't be so reckless.

82
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:52,190
Do you hear me?

83
00:06:53,349 --> 00:06:54,550
Yeah, I hear you.

84
00:06:55,389 --> 00:06:56,389
Come on.

85
00:07:11,257 --> 00:07:13,457
(Zhang Wenming,
a prominent Luosen City entrepreneur,)

86
00:07:13,457 --> 00:07:15,057
(was found dead in his home.)

87
00:07:15,062 --> 00:07:18,949
(Reportedly, he had previously
clashed with Zhao Lu,)

88
00:07:18,949 --> 00:07:20,308
(a Prosperity shareholder.)

89
00:07:20,491 --> 00:07:22,171
(From the murder weapon at the scene,)

90
00:07:22,171 --> 00:07:25,330
(police have identified Zhao Lu
as the prime suspect.)

91
00:07:25,410 --> 00:07:27,152
(A warrant has been issued.)

92
00:07:43,441 --> 00:07:44,441
What are you doing?

93
00:07:45,561 --> 00:07:47,522
Nie Feng is obviously behind this.

94
00:07:47,681 --> 00:07:48,921
I'll have it out with him.

95
00:07:52,042 --> 00:07:53,042
Be careful.

96
00:07:57,001 --> 00:07:58,481
Don't you want to leave with me?

97
00:08:00,202 --> 00:08:01,202
Wait for me.

98
00:08:35,561 --> 00:08:36,762
Were you expecting me?

99
00:08:39,642 --> 00:08:41,561
Did you forget that I installed
your security system?

100
00:08:42,081 --> 00:08:43,081
Framing me,

101
00:08:43,801 --> 00:08:44,801
putting out a warrant,

102
00:08:45,961 --> 00:08:47,122
and trying to squeeze me out?

103
00:08:47,642 --> 00:08:48,642
Lu,

104
00:08:49,441 --> 00:08:50,441
sit.

105
00:09:00,841 --> 00:09:02,201
You gave me this gun.

106
00:09:04,282 --> 00:09:05,601
I've kept it all these years.

107
00:09:06,522 --> 00:09:07,762
The M1911.

108
00:09:08,081 --> 00:09:09,162
I remember this gun

109
00:09:09,762 --> 00:09:11,601
is a Commander model.

110
00:09:11,921 --> 00:09:16,122
It took me a lot of effort
to buy it from the army back then.

111
00:09:16,321 --> 00:09:17,362
Stop patronizing me.

112
00:09:17,841 --> 00:09:19,002
I'm not a kid anymore.

113
00:09:20,882 --> 00:09:22,282
My dad told me later

114
00:09:23,522 --> 00:09:26,561
that back in your day,
they were all over the street.

115
00:09:27,042 --> 00:09:28,362
Still, I always remembered

116
00:09:28,762 --> 00:09:30,402
you were the first to give me a gun.

117
00:09:30,642 --> 00:09:31,961
I call you brother.

118
00:09:34,921 --> 00:09:37,002
So you still remember I'm your brother?

119
00:09:39,081 --> 00:09:41,122
When you were doing
all that for Jiasheng,

120
00:09:41,122 --> 00:09:44,122
did you still think of me
as your brother?

121
00:09:45,882 --> 00:09:47,482
Lu, don't you realize?

122
00:09:47,482 --> 00:09:51,642
We're the brothers who grew up together.

123
00:09:51,801 --> 00:09:53,961
We belong to the same circle.

124
00:09:54,002 --> 00:09:56,601
And our interests are tied together!

125
00:09:58,122 --> 00:10:00,201
I was planning to get rid of Tu Jiasheng

126
00:10:00,201 --> 00:10:02,242
and leave Prosperity to you!

127
00:10:06,961 --> 00:10:09,002
Do you really think
I care about Prosperity?

128
00:10:10,601 --> 00:10:12,561
When have either of us
ever lacked money?

129
00:10:13,242 --> 00:10:14,561
Do you think I actually enjoy

130
00:10:14,601 --> 00:10:16,122
wallowing in debauchery every day,

131
00:10:16,122 --> 00:10:17,362
trailing behind you two,

132
00:10:17,402 --> 00:10:19,282
watching you kiss up and kick down,

133
00:10:19,601 --> 00:10:20,882
telling everyone what

134
00:10:20,882 --> 00:10:22,321
they want to hear?

135
00:10:23,601 --> 00:10:26,921
All I wanted was for the three of us
to do something together. Anything.

136
00:10:32,122 --> 00:10:33,441
My dear Lu,

137
00:10:33,441 --> 00:10:38,362
do you still think
Prosperity is just a nightclub?

138
00:10:40,122 --> 00:10:41,561
Let me tell you,

139
00:10:41,681 --> 00:10:44,122
Prosperity is a path
straight to the top!

140
00:10:44,801 --> 00:10:47,801
I'm leading you to the very top!

141
00:10:48,841 --> 00:10:51,362
Second to none, above millions!

142
00:10:52,282 --> 00:10:53,282
Isn't that good?

143
00:10:54,002 --> 00:10:55,122
Won't you be happy?

144
00:10:56,081 --> 00:10:57,282
A path to the top?

145
00:10:59,841 --> 00:11:01,762
So you used us as stepping stones?

146
00:11:04,642 --> 00:11:05,961
I could let things slide.

147
00:11:06,402 --> 00:11:07,762
I could look the other way.

148
00:11:08,402 --> 00:11:09,801
But I'm not disposable.

149
00:11:09,801 --> 00:11:11,282
I'm not a prostitute!

150
00:11:13,522 --> 00:11:14,721
Brothers

151
00:11:16,522 --> 00:11:18,122
are not for sale.

152
00:11:23,601 --> 00:11:25,122
Lu, let me be clear.

153
00:11:27,561 --> 00:11:30,201
I will win the speaker election
no matter what.

154
00:11:30,762 --> 00:11:33,561
I won't let anyone get in my way.

155
00:11:35,282 --> 00:11:36,961
You sent Yu Yingwan away.

156
00:11:37,482 --> 00:11:38,921
She was my asset.

157
00:11:39,321 --> 00:11:41,282
You cut the cigarette supply
into Sea Breeze.

158
00:11:41,282 --> 00:11:43,321
That was handing Tu Jiasheng a weapon.

159
00:11:45,081 --> 00:11:47,362
You only have two options now:

160
00:11:47,882 --> 00:11:52,762
either follow me to the top

161
00:11:52,801 --> 00:11:54,961
and stand above everyone else,

162
00:11:56,242 --> 00:12:01,601
or get discarded by me
just like your father,

163
00:12:01,721 --> 00:12:03,561
and plunge into the abyss!

164
00:12:10,681 --> 00:12:11,681
Above everyone else?

165
00:12:13,961 --> 00:12:15,561
Do you think if you climb up there,

166
00:12:15,601 --> 00:12:17,601
the people up top will even see you?

167
00:12:18,081 --> 00:12:20,762
When you look down,
you don't even see us.

168
00:12:22,201 --> 00:12:24,482
And that's exactly how they look at you.

169
00:12:34,961 --> 00:12:35,961
Here's what we'll do.

170
00:12:37,801 --> 00:12:38,961
I want nothing.

171
00:12:41,522 --> 00:12:42,762
I'll leave Prosperity

172
00:12:43,482 --> 00:12:45,522
and give all my shares back to you.

173
00:12:47,201 --> 00:12:48,762
Call off the warrant

174
00:12:50,042 --> 00:12:51,282
and let Manni and me go.

175
00:12:54,681 --> 00:12:55,921
Between us brothers,

176
00:12:57,362 --> 00:12:58,362
we'll be even.

177
00:12:59,522 --> 00:13:01,762
Consider it the last favor
I ever ask of you.

178
00:13:05,242 --> 00:13:06,242
Thank you, Feng.

179
00:13:19,441 --> 00:13:21,081
If you'd thought this way earlier,

180
00:13:22,681 --> 00:13:24,762
there might've been room to talk.

181
00:13:26,721 --> 00:13:27,721
But now,

182
00:13:31,721 --> 00:13:32,721
it's too late.

183
00:14:15,679 --> 00:14:19,295
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

184
00:14:19,665 --> 00:14:23,650
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

185
00:14:28,406 --> 00:14:31,725
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

186
00:14:31,725 --> 00:14:36,810
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

187
00:14:40,399 --> 00:14:46,951
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

188
00:14:46,951 --> 00:14:55,372
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

189
00:14:55,372 --> 00:14:58,601
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

190
00:14:58,601 --> 00:15:01,796
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

191
00:15:01,796 --> 00:15:04,489
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

192
00:15:04,489 --> 00:15:09,106
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

193
00:15:13,017 --> 00:15:15,506
♪Burning alone♪

194
00:15:21,012 --> 00:15:27,381
♪The glory fades♪
